WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Select one independently created Figma
frame.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.400
Choose Send existing frame to Conductor.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.300
Choose project, deliverable and feature.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.336
Set a unique name, appearance and matching
breakpoint.

00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:23.373
Check annotations, review the full
destination, then send.

00:00:24.773 --> 00:00:28.273
Open the saved feature’s Design
discussion.
